1
00:00:00,046 --> 00:00:02,624
And the book is framed by a promise.

2
00:00:03,065 --> 00:00:06,838
Near the beginning, the child is called Immanuel, which means, God with us.

3
00:00:07,442 --> 00:00:15,337
At the very end, the risen Jesus says: and surely I am with you always, even to the end of the age. The same promise, opening and closing the book.

